Bug 2076478 - Show check marks again in calendar menus. r=mkmelin

Since bug 2010038 menu items no longer take their checked state from their
command. Copy it from the command when a menu opens, and set the checked state
of the task priority and progress items on the items themselves. The "None"
status item now carries its own hidden state.

Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D329878

